Cuisines are used overnight to serve customers visiting the izakaya or during the day to fulfill tasks. A selection of cuisines is chosen to form a menu for the night, but cuisines not on the menu can still be cooked for rare customers using the available ingredients. Additionally, extra [[Ingredients]] can be added to any cuisine to change its properties. Trying to add a property marked with an X to a cuisine will result in it becoming dark matter.

